# Competitor reverse-engineering materials stay local: proprietary unpacked
# extension code, scraped site assets and archives must not be published.
competitor-analysis/*
!competitor-analysis/qiuzhifangzhou/
competitor-analysis/qiuzhifangzhou/*
!competitor-analysis/qiuzhifangzhou/REPORT.md

# .scan/ holds local agent analysis output (unpacked competitor extensions,
# source dumps, prompts). Same rule as competitor-analysis: never published.
.scan/

# .wayfinder/ is the local planning tracker for the base-component upgrade.
# Maps and tickets are working notes for sessions on this machine; the
# decisions they record land in docs/component-spec.md once settled, so the
# tracker itself stays out of the published history.
.wayfinder/

